cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "Peptide scoring-function affinity benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark for ranking peptide series by predicted binding affinity across
  10 datasets and 8 targets, comparing scoring functions by signed rank
  correlation to measured potency. This release holds the procedure and the
  input structures. It holds no results.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Receptor.AI, Inc."
    website: "https://receptor.ai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/receptor-ai/receptor-ai-peptide-benchmarks"
url: "https://github.com/receptor-ai/receptor-ai-peptide-benchmarks"
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-21"
keywords:
  - peptides
  - binding affinity
  - scoring function
  - benchmark
